// OutsideAgentService manages the outside agents of one tenant (epic
// gibson#1366, gibson#1403).
//
// An outside agent is an A2A agent that runs outside Gibson. A tenant admin
// registers its name, the HTTPS URL of its A2A endpoint and the name of a tenant
// secret for its credential. The tenant operator turns each record into one
// route on the Agent gateway. A mission agent calls the outside agent through
// that route, and the gateway asks ext-authz first.
//
// No default grant exists. A tenant admin grants an outside agent to one mission
// with GrantOutsideAgent. A mission with no grant gets a refusal at the gateway.
//
// Authorization: every RPC carries a (gibson.auth.v1.authz) annotation.

